    "created_at": "2015-07-13T06:49:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-07-13T06:49:22Z",
    "body": "So I think the problem with this was that with the potential for cross-process scenarios we'd end up with a way where you could observe a state change while the event hasn't fired. But maybe we should cross that bridge when it comes.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
