    "created_at": "2015-07-13T07:53:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-07-13T07:53:33Z",
    "body": "I don't think it's a fundamental problem either, especially given that we don't even specify the order of the fullscreenchange event and resize event. (Actually Gecko currently can trigger multiple resize events for fullscreen... which I'm going to fix some day...)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
